{#
  partials/confidence-badge.njk — an attribution-confidence level as a badge.

  Usage: set `confidenceLevel` before including.
    {% set confidenceLevel = hunt.confidence_level %}
    {% include "partials/confidence-badge.njk" %}

  Renders the bare level ("confirmed", "high", "medium", "low"). .badge sets
  the uppercase, so the wording is the same on every page; a caller that wants
  the word "confidence" next to it writes that in its own text. DELIBERATELY
  ON ONE LINE, so it sits inline inside a heading or a sentence.
#}<span class="badge badge--{{ confidenceLevel }}">{{ confidenceLevel }}</span>